V5含实验室检查，但不能据此推断PK/PD采样安排。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_b4858ae428ff_720525188aa14910","section_number":"4.2.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a0cdc6884cedf8b188220da7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb71242d679bdb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261009162539_44422089","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:revision:4","quote":"受试者1:1随机至KZ-HA501组或安慰剂组，治疗期12周","quote_sha256":"d92e06d19fc4803db09486c6b0da8de65656cb5f5b4a1c5c50bcf7e86eb01716","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","span_id":"es_study_def_random"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:revision:4","quote":"分层因素为基线3个月内发作次数（1-3次 vs ≥4次）与是否12-17岁青少年","quote_sha256":"b821f6c3c17b9af498cff6d4e2ba12e62ae5814d8cfb5b32efe1158ca078fab0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","span_id":"es_study_def_random_strat"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:revision:4","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照II期发作预防研究","quote_sha256":"aaf28cbd64bd54d51461245ee4a24ddc1a882828f9881e91c94d6c18c3834a2b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","span_id":"es_study_def_blind_design"},{"locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:352|chunk:1","quote":"本研究为双盲随机设计，试验参与者、研究者、监查员以及数据分析人员等对试验参与者接受某剂量试验用药品类别属于试验药物/安慰剂均不知情。","quote_sha256":"202e6203bbc6cbaf71c237f934be73b9c60099c19f1e48aa487003f531a501c6","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","span_id":"es_corpus_blind_scope"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_study_def_random","es_study_def_random_strat","es_study_def_blind_design","es_corpus_blind_scope"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认随机化具体方法（区组随机或简单随机）、区组大小、随机化生成软件及版本","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_rand_01","missing_source_classes":["随机化实施方案"],"target":"4.3 随机化"},{"action":"确认随机化实施系统（IWRS/IRT）名称及操作流程","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_rand_02","missing_source_classes":["IWRS/IRT操作手册"],"target":"4.3 随机化"}],"heading":"随机化","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照设计。受试者按1:1比例随机分配至KZ-HA501组（40 mg每日两次口服）或安慰剂对照组。随机化采用分层随机方法，分层因素为基线3个月内HAE发作次数（1-3次与≥4次）以及是否为12-17岁青少年。随机化分配在基线访视（V2）完成，随机后进入12周双盲治疗期。随机化实施通过交互式网络应答系统完成，由独立于研究中心的随机化统计师在研究启动前生成随机分配表，确保各中心入组顺序不影响组别分配。","rationale":"随机化比例1:1、分层因素（基线发作次数和年龄）来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。随机化实施通过IWRS及独立统计师生成随机表为结构参照，具体实施系统名称和随机化方法细节（如区组大小）需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（随机化）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_b4858ae428ff_eea4c5d0a7fe957e","section_number":"4.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a0cdc6884cedf8b188220da7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb71242d679bdb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261009162539_44422089","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂外观与KZ-HA501一致，由不参与评估的药师发放维持盲态","quote_sha256":"5b15f36b395c992cc9e8c3a5f9603a962d0767719c5932eed759bf710c58d975","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","span_id":"es_study_def_blind"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:revision:4","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照II期发作预防研究","quote_sha256":"aaf28cbd64bd54d51461245ee4a24ddc1a882828f9881e91c94d6c18c3834a2b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","span_id":"es_study_def_blind_design"},{"locator":"section:研究揭盲|block:464|chunk:1","quote":"数据经盲态核查、清理，确定统计分析集人群，数据冻结或数据库锁定，此时，由授权的人员揭盲，即将各参与者的随机编号所对应的组别告知统计人员，以便对全部数据进行统计分析。","quote_sha256":"28fc3296e98e7793141221c4f6dd36a810f588fde79cc49c2b03a9aea2a5ec71","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","span_id":"es_corpus_unblind"},{"locator":"section:6.3.3 揭盲|block:490|chunk:1","quote":"紧急揭盲借助IWRS中","quote_sha256":"60f7f308cc31286e41cd0e263ec3058002ea024fab20328dd9ee9d91a101af72","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","span_id":"es_corpus_emergency_unblind"},{"locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:352|chunk:1","quote":"本研究为双盲随机设计，试验参与者、研究者、监查员以及数据分析人员等对试验参与者接受某剂量试验用药品类别属于试验药物/安慰剂均不知情。","quote_sha256":"202e6203bbc6cbaf71c237f934be73b9c60099c19f1e48aa487003f531a501c6","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","span_id":"es_corpus_blind_scope"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_study_def_blind","es_study_def_blind_design","es_corpus_unblind","es_corpus_emergency_unblind","es_corpus_blind_scope"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":3,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认本项目紧急揭盲是否通过IWRS实施、揭盲后处理流程及记录要求","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_blind_01","missing_source_classes":["IWRS操作手册","紧急揭盲SOP"],"target":"4.4 盲法与揭盲"},{"action":"确认盲态维护人员范围（是否包含监查员、数据分析人员、PK实验室人员等）","category":"decision_pending","gap_id":"gap_blind_02","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"4.4 盲法与揭盲"}],"heading":"盲法与揭盲","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用双盲设计。KZ-HA501薄膜衣片与安慰剂在外观、气味和包装上保持一致，由不参与疗效和安全性评估的药师负责发放以维持盲态。受试者、研究者及参与疗效与安全性评估的人员在研究期间不知晓受试者所接受的是KZ-HA501还是安慰剂。紧急情况下，研究者可通过交互式网络应答系统进行紧急揭盲以获取受试者实际用药信息，揭盲后该受试者终止试验用药品治疗，研究者须记录揭盲原因、日期及处理情况。研究全部数据完成盲态核查和数据库锁定后，由授权人员统一揭盲，将随机编号对应的组别信息告知统计分析人员，以开展最终统计分析。","rationale":"双盲设计、安慰剂外观一致、由不参与评估的药师发放来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。紧急揭盲通过IWRS操作及揭盲后终止治疗、研究结束统一揭盲的流程为公司语料中的结构参照，具体是否采用IWRS紧急揭盲、盲态维护人员范围（是否包含监查员和数据分析人员）需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（盲法与揭盲）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_b4858ae428ff_ff1031807bc2925c","section_number":"4.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a0cdc6884cedf8b188220da7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb71242d679bdb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261009162539_44422089","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_b4858ae428ff_ba44e26131af2bef:full-draft:a0cdc6884cedf8b188220da7","quote":"设置独立数据监查委员会（DMC）","quote_sha256":"ed66d6060d86028cbf9c8ac6cdb1e6dc05d941bc80fde1d78edc4b67f7b84a0a","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:a0cdc6884cedf8b188220da7","span_id":"es_selection_dmc"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:revision:4","quote":"DMC是否计划：是","quote_sha256":"9967a9a75297ced2326ab733fa3b16934acdef641fa765dd50c1cd58219f4aa5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","span_id":"es_study_def_dmc"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:revision:4","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE发生率与严重程度（CTCAE 5.0）；生命体征、12导联心电图、临床实验室检查较基线变化；肝酶升高与qt间期延长的特别监测。","quote_sha256":"06515ac1078dcbcf7bd2f61558fc6fffce2a42041de93032bc15aa02cbcfb787","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","span_id":"es_study_def_safety"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:revision:4","quote":"特别关注的不良事件：肝功能异常（ALT/AST>3×ULN伴胆红素升高）；QTcF>500ms或较基线延长>60ms；严重过敏/超敏反应。","quote_sha256":"1d4cf10bbbb48b2944356ffdf4112d6296fd00423d2bc13c456b2bd96c94121b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","span_id":"es_study_def_sae"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_selection_dmc","es_study_def_dmc","es_study_def_safety","es_study_def_sae"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取DMC章程，确认DMC成员组成（专业背景、人数）、审查频率、审查内容、触发标准及与申办者/研究者的沟通机制","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_dmc_01","missing_source_classes":["DMC章程","DMC操作手册"],"target":"4.5 安全性审评/数据监查委员会"},{"action":"确认DMC审查的具体安全性数据范围、报告格式及决策流程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_dmc_02","missing_source_classes":["DMC审查SOP"],"target":"4.5 安全性审评/数据监查委员会"}],"heading":"安全性审评/数据监查委员会","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究设置独立数据监查委员会（DMC），负责在研究期间对累积安全性数据进行定期审查，重点关注特别关注的不良事件，包括肝功能异常（ALT/AST>3×ULN伴胆红素升高）、QTcF>500 ms或较基线延长>60 ms以及严重过敏/超敏反应。DMC审查内容包括累积不良事件发生率与严重程度（按CTCAE 5.0分级）、生命体征与12导联心电图变化趋势、临床实验室检查异常以及各治疗组间安全性信号。DMC根据审查结果向申办者提出继续、修改或终止研究的建议。DMC成员由独立于研究团队和申办者的临床药理、血液/免疫学及统计学专家组成，具体人数、审查频率、触发标准及沟通机制在DMC章程中规定。","rationale":"DMC设置及特别关注不良事件（肝功能异常、QTcF延长、严重过敏/超敏反应）来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。DMC审查内容框架参照安全性终点定义。DMC具体组成人数、审查频率、触发标准和沟通机制缺少项目文件支持，需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_b4858ae428ff_2b4d15eda7a1e01d","section_number":"4.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a0cdc6884cedf8b188220da7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb71242d679bdb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"968a8a96eac3022d6b0213b687fe664c95c80d231a2dd059805c891e823e045c","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_b4858ae428ff_ba44e26131af2bef:full-draft:a0cdc6884cedf8b188220da7","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:a0cdc6884cedf8b188220da7","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:3ffd7d1e98990c139aa2d6cbabe6e9a477954c19ec7cf663f4e63eb18dca0f45:a0cdc6884cedf8b188220da7","text_sha256":"968a8a96eac3022d6b0213b687fe664c95c80d231a2dd059805c891e823e045c"},{"content_sha256":"1ccc46e2501752c77ea7f706de0b7d5cf123985689cad4de02d210504a1bf602","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","text_sha256":"1ccc46e2501752c77ea7f706de0b7d5cf123985689cad4de02d210504a1bf602"},{"content_sha256":"1541424a072504b13dc999a7346751e32eebb848cc0771bb2ef3908b11c26ea0","locator":"section:研究揭盲|block:464|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"4a27cdd782c3be","text_sha256":"1541424a072504b13dc999a7346751e32eebb848cc0771bb2ef3908b1